  "description": "It was somewhere  \nLove is something you can see at a glance.  \nIf so, this is also... After all, it was love. Jiwon fell in love at first sight with Yoomin,\n\n\nthe master of 'Midnight Combo', a cocktail bar he accidentally visited ! After that, I go to the 'Midnight Combo' every day... Jiwon and his best friend Haechan. Yoo-min and his best friend Woo-chan. Even Jung Hoon, a super-beautiful man whose insides are unknown.... A delightful cocktail bar with no quiet days, a midnight combo!\n\n**Original Webtoon: **  \n[Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/4425000001), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/comic/ep_list/midN_2), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/midnight_combo)\n\n*Official Japanese Translation:*  \n[Amazon Fliptoon](https://www.amazon.co.jp/-/en/dp/B0BGKYPLPY) (Wait for free upto 18 chapters)  \n[Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.jp/ja/comic/midnight_combo)",
